      "summary": "This subject introduces the top down and bottom up processes for manufacturing of advanced materials. The course will discuss current techniques in materials manufacturing, including solid/liquid/gaseous-state synthesis and crystal growth, thin film technology, polymer processing and 3D print, additive manufacturing and device fabrication. This course will discuss how to shape the nanomaterials, thin films, bulk materials and flexible materials for different applications. The course will also discuss future developments of technologies and sustainable methods of manufacturing and recycling.",
