      "handbookUrl": "https://programsandcourses.anu.edu.au/course/PHYS3106",
      "summary": "Nuclear technologies and nuclear-science techniques have a diverse range of applications from power generation to cancer therapy. This course will introduce you to current and emerging nuclear technologies of relevance to Australia and the Asia-Pacific region, including the nuclear fuel cycle, nuclear-based energy generation, safeguards and non-proliferation measures, and nuclear medicine. You will also learn about particle accelerators and their application in science and industry. In doing so, you will be able to assess nuclear technologies and applications in terms of the underlying science, and use that knowledge to create relevant simulations with suitable computational tools.",
