      "summary": "The course will involve research experiences relevant to the study of psychology. The format will depend on the research opportunities available each year. Formats might include conducting a research project or components of a research project, working with postgraduate students, participating in research conferences, and winter/summer research intensives. All opportunities will be supervised by a psychology academic from the School of Medicine and Psychology, either alone or in collaboration with academics from other disciplines. Options available each year will be posted online at https://psychology.anu.edu.au/study/special-topics. This is a restricted entry course - applications should occur through the nominated academic for each specific project. This is an Honours Pathway Course.",
